# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# InsightPilot — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in values.
# Without any key the app runs in DEMO MODE (returns a realistic sample result).

# ── Option A: OpenAI ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini     # default — fast, cheap, great JSON output
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o          # best quality

# ── Option B: OpenRouter (100+ models, many free) ─────────────────────────────
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
#
# ⚠️  IMPORTANT: use the API model ID — NOT the display name from the UI.
#     Format: provider/model-name  (find it at openrouter.ai/models → "API name")
#
# ── RECOMMENDED FREE MODELS (ranked by JSON reliability) ─────────────────────
#
# ★ Best overall free:
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free
#
# ★ Fast + reliable:
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=meta-llama/llama-3.1-8b-instruct:free
#
# ★ Google — excellent quality when available:
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=google/gemini-2.0-flash-exp:free
#
# ★ Mistral — lightweight, good instruction following:
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=mistralai/mistral-7b-instruct:free
#
# ★ Qwen — strong at structured output:
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=qwen/qwen-2.5-7b-instruct:free
#
# ── AVOID for this app ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ✗ Reasoning/thinking models (deepseek-r1, o1, QwQ, Nemotron-reasoning, etc.)
#   They output long <think> chains and often fail structured JSON tasks.
# ✗ Models with "omni", "nano", "mini" reasoning variants on free tier —
#   they commonly return empty responses for complex structured prompts.
#
# ── Paid models (better quality, no rate limits) ──────────────────────────────
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini          # default if key is set, no suffix
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=google/gemini-2.0-flash-001

# ── Demo Mode ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Force demo mode even when a key is present (useful for UI testing)
# DEMO_MODE=true
